[TITLE]
NUM-10: 5 cfs into J0, over weir W1 into junction J1, drained by DUMMY conduit D1.
The CONDUITS section comes before WEIRS (the order the SWMM GUI writes), so D1
has a lower link index than W1. Correct result: D1 passes the 5 cfs, no flooding.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             02:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         5
VARIABLE_STEP        0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J0     10   5        0         0        0
J1     0    5        0         0        0
J2     10   5        0         0        0

[OUTFALLS]
O1     9    FREE

[CONDUITS]
C1     J2  O1  100  0.013  0  0  0  0
D1     J1  J2  100  0.013  0  0  0  0

[WEIRS]
;;Name From To Type CrestHt Cd Gated EC Cd2
W1     J0  J1  TRANSVERSE  0  3.33  NO  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 2 0 0 0 1
D1     DUMMY    0 0 0 0 1
W1     RECT_OPEN 2 5 0 0

[INFLOWS]
J0  FLOW  ""  FLOW 1.0 1.0 5

[REPORT]
